DESCRIPTION:Rank: Simple, Privileged Major Feria\nColor: Violet\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers: Not permitted\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nCommemorations: St. John of Capistrano, Confessor\nPenitential kneeling.\nAfter None, 2nd Oration: Commemoration of St. John of Capistrano, Confessor, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino".\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms, Commemoration of St. John of Capistrano, Confessor, Ferial Preces\n- Prime: Add Ps. 96 (displaced from Lauds) as fourth psalm, Ferial Preces\n- Day hours: Ferial Preces\n- Compline: Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2029/3/28/\n
END:VEVENT
