DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280110
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20280110T024822Z
UID:c635cb10dcf2d64daeb50672dc05fbf7ebb5f9e7@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble\nColor: White\nFlowers are permitted.\nThe organ may be played.\nCommemorations: None\nNo penitential kneeling.\nAfter Terce, the conventual Mass is of the Sunday within the Octave of the Epiphany (resumed — the Sunday being impeded by the Holy Family), with a commemoration of the day within the octave.\nFolded Chasubles are not worn.\nGloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: Epiphany\nProper Communicantes/Hanc Igitur: Epiphany\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Epiphany\n- Hymn Tone: Epiphany\n- Prime: Verse = "Qui apparuisti hodie"\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2028/1/10/\n
END:VEVENT
