DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble, Privileged Vigil of the Second Class\nColor: White/Violet/Red\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers: Yes, for the Mass and thereafter\nOrgan: Yes, for the Mass and thereafter\nPenitential kneeling: No penitential kneeling during the Easter season\nAfter None, Six Prophecies, Blessing of Baptismal Water, Litany of the Saints, then Mass w/o Introit, no Commemorations. Private Mass w/out Vigil but w/ Introit is permitted..\nFolded Chasubles: Yes, for the Vigil before Mass\nGloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Ghost\nProper Communicantes/Hanc Igitur: Proper Communicantes and Hanc Igitur of Pentecost\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Ascension (through None)\n- Hymn Tone: Ascension (through None)\n- Prime: Verse = "Qui scandis super sidera"\n- Compline: Hymn sung with the Proper Doxology and melody of Pentecost\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/5/23/\n
END:VEVENT
