UID:9625bf54aab658ce5513d62321615fc1b493e2a9@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Simple, Privileged Major Feria\nColor: Violet\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers are not permitted.\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nPenitential kneeling.\nAfter None, 2nd. Orations "Contra Persecutores" or "Pro Papa", no 3rd. Orations, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino"..\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms, Ferial Preces\n- Prime: Add Ps. 96 (displaced from Lauds) as fourth psalm, Ferial Preces\n- Day hours: Ferial Preces\n- Compline: Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/4/1/\n
