SUMMARY:Palm Sunday
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260329
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260329T024822Z
UID:8962a5d7c000c4899f1ef0b455f98a8b1a38992b@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble, Privileged Sunday of the First Class\nColor: Violet\nFlowers are not permitted.\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nAfter Terce, Asperges followed by the "Missa Sicca" for the Blessing & Procession of Palms, no Commemorations at Mass, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino". At other Masses not preceded by the blessing/procession of palms, in which the Passion is read, Proper Last Gospel of the "Missa Sicca"..\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms\n- Prime: Pss. 92 & 99 (displaced from Lauds) replace Ps. 117 (moved to Lauds) as the first two psalms, Dominical Preces\n- Day hours: Dominical Preces\n- Compline: Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/29/\n
END:VEVENT
