DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble\nColor: White\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers are permitted.\nThe organ may be played.\nCommemorations: Passiontide Feria\nPenitential kneeling: Only at the Ferial Mass\nAfter Terce, Mass of the feast, Commemoration and Proper Last Gospel of the Feria, 3rd. Orations "Contra Persecutores" or "Pro Papa". After None, Mass of the Feria w/ the seasonal commemoration. .\nFolded Chasubles: (Only at the Ferial Mass)\nGloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Matins: Lesson IX of the Feria\n- Lauds: Commemoration of the Feria\n- Prime: Dominical Preces\n- Compline: Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/28/\n
END:VEVENT
