DESCRIPTION:Rank: Double Major\nColor: White\nPenance: Fast & Abstinence\nFlowers are permitted.\nThe organ may be played.\nCommemorations: St. John Damascene, Confessor & Doctor; Passiontide Feria\nPenitential kneeling: Only at the Ferial Mass\nAfter Terce, Mass of the feast, Commemorations of St. John Damascene and of the Feria, Proper Last Gospel of the Feria. After None, Mass of the Feria w/ the seasonal commemoration. .\nFolded Chasubles: (Only at the Ferial Mass)\nGloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: BVM ("Et te in Transfixione")\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Seven Sorrows\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Matins: Lesson IX of the Feria\n- Lauds: Commemorations of St. John Damascene and of the Feria\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/27/\n
