DESCRIPTION:Rank: Simple, Major Feria not Privileged\nColor: Violet\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers are not permitted.\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nPenitential kneeling: Yes, through None/Mass\nAfter None, 2nd. Orations "Contra Persecutores" or "Pro Papa", no 3rd. Orations, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino"..\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum (through None)\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms, Ferial Preces\n- Prime: Add Ps. 97 (displaced from Lauds) as fourth psalm, Ferial Preces\n- Day hours: Ferial Preces\n- Compline: Hymn sung with the Proper Doxology of the Seven Sorrows, no Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/26/\n
