BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annunciation of the BVM
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260325
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260325T024822Z
UID:1597c2b12b895da7eca7299c44b10b43f45e6f4d@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Double First Class\nColor: White\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers are permitted.\nThe organ may be played.\nCommemorations: Passiontide Feria\nPenitential kneeling: Only at the Ferial Mass\nAfter Terce, Mass of the feast, Commemoration and Proper Last Gospel of the Feria. After None, a private Mass of the Feria is allowed w/ the seasonal commemoration. .\nFolded Chasubles: (Only at the Ferial Mass)\nGloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: BVM ("Et te in Annuntiatione")\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Incarnation\n- Hymn Tone: BVM\n- Matins: Lesson IX of the Feria\n- Lauds: Commemoration of the Feria\n- Prime: Verse = "Qui natus es"\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/25/\n
END:VEVENT
