DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260323T024822Z
UID:1d5919d8b0d0892e5c0bd41ef85d8db4c84a9661@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Simple, Major Feria not Privileged\nColor: Violet\nPenance: Fast & Partial Abstinence\nFlowers are not permitted.\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nAfter None, 2nd. Orations "Contra Persecutores" or "Pro Papa", no 3rd. Orations, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino"..\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nNo Credo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms, Ferial Preces\n- Prime: Add Ps. 46 (displaced from Lauds) as fourth psalm, Ferial Preces\n- Day hours: Ferial Preces\n- Compline: No Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/23/\n
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Passion Sunday
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260322
DTSTAMP;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T024822Z
UID:c0955d89c35e8fd781cccd00db3d020ec4f4f0c6@ordo.restorethe54.com
DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble, Privileged Sunday of the First Class\nColor: Violet\nFlowers are not permitted.\nOrgan: Only to accompany singing\nAfter Terce, 2nd. Orations "Contra Persecutores" or "Pro Papa", no 3rd. Orations, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino". In all Masses of the season from today through Holy Thursday, both Ps. 42 and the minor doxology "Gloria Patri" are omitted; these, however, are retained in Masses of feasts during the week ahead..\nFolded Chasubles are worn.\nNo Gloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: Holy Cross\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum\n- Hymn Tone: Passiontide\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms\n- Prime: Pss. 92 & 99 (displaced from Lauds) replace Ps. 117 (moved to Lauds) as the first two psalms, Dominical Preces\n- Day hours: Dominical Preces\n- Compline: Preces\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/3/22/\n
END:VEVENT
