DESCRIPTION:Rank: Semidouble, Privileged Sunday of the Second Class\nColor: Violet\nFlowers are permitted.\nThe organ may be played.\nCommemorations: St. Ignatius of Antioch, Bishop & Martyr\nAfter Terce, Commemoration of St. Ignatius, no 3rd. Orations, Dismissal = "Benedicamus Domino"..\nFolded Chasubles are not worn.\nNo Gloria.\nCredo.\nPreface: Trinity\n\nOffice:\n- Doxology: Per Annum (through None)\n- Hymn Tone: Ordinary (through None)\n- Lauds: Second Schema of Psalms, Commemoration of St. Ignatius; no Suffrage\n- Prime: Pss. 92 & 99 (displaced from Lauds) replace Ps. 117 (moved to Lauds) as the first two psalms, no Preces\n- Compline: Hymn takes the Proper Doxology of the Incarnation sung in the melody of the BVM\n\nWeb ordo info at: https://ordo.restorethe54.com/ordo/2026/2/1/\n
END:VEVENT
